{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7v3sh6xj","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":37,"title":"Ich bin Lehrerin","nativeTitle":"I Am a Teacher","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Nico","Lisa","Max","Tarek"],"speakerGenders":{"Nico":"male","Lisa":"female","Max":"male","Tarek":"male"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Das ist die Adresse und die Telefonnummer.","native":"This is the address and the phone number."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ich kenne die Adresse. Ich komme morgen mit.","native":"I know the address. I'll come along tomorrow."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Das ist super!","native":"That's great!"},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Wohin gehst du?","native":"Where are you going?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ich habe gleich ein Bewerbungsgespräch .","native":"I have a job interview in a moment."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Was ist dein Beruf ? Arbeitest du nicht als Lehrerin?","native":"What is your profession? Don't you work as a teacher?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Doch. Ich bin Lehrerin für Deutsch und Englisch. Aber ich habe keine feste Arbeit an einer Schule.","native":"Yes, I do. I'm a teacher for German and English. But I don't have a permanent job at a school."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Und die Sprachkurse?","native":"And the language courses?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Die Sprachkurse sind nur ein Nebenjob. Jetzt brauch ich eine richtige Arbeit.","native":"The language courses are just a side job. Now I need a real job."},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Viel Erfolg !","native":"Good luck!"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Viel Glück!","native":"Good luck!"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Danke. Tschüss!","native":"Thanks. Bye!"},{"speaker":"Tarek","target":"Tschau, Lisa!","native":"Ciao, Lisa!"},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Arbeitest du schon?","native":"Are you working yet?"},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Welchen Beruf findest du gut? Möchtest du auch Lehrer werden?","native":"Which profession do you like? Would you also like to become a teacher?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Meine Eltern sagen, Ingenieur ist gut.","native":"My parents say engineer is good."},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Und du?","native":"And you?"},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Ich war lange in einer Bank . Ich bin Bankkaufmann .","native":"I was at a bank for a long time. I'm a bank clerk."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Das verstehe ich nicht. Du hast doch ein Restaurant.","native":"I don't understand that. You have a restaurant, after all."},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Stimmt . Zusammen mit Tarek. Tarek ist eigentlich Elektriker von Beruf .","native":"True. Together with Tarek. Tarek is actually an electrician by profession."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Warum?","native":"Why?"},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Na ja, wir finden die Arbeit im Restaurant interessant. Es macht Spaß. Und hier sind Tarek und ich die Chefs .","native":"Well, we find the work in the restaurant interesting. It's fun. And here Tarek and I are the bosses."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Du arbeitest also gerne im Restaurant.","native":"So you like working in the restaurant."},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Ja. Ich mag meine Arbeit. Und Tarek auch. Oder, Tarek?","native":"Yes. I like my work. And Tarek does too. Right, Tarek?"},{"speaker":"Tarek","target":"Klar mag ich meinen Job. Und du findest bestimmt auch noch ’ne gute Arbeit!","native":"Of course I like my job. And you'll surely find a good job too!"}],"teach":null,"wordData":null,"progress":{"teach":false,"full":false,"practice":null},"createdAt":1795063529487,"updatedAt":1795063529521},"course":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","name":"Nicos Weg","level":"","from":"","to":"German","createdAt":1795063529520,"custom":true},"pack":{"v":1,"lines":{"0":{"f":"Das ist die Adresse und die Telefonnummer.","fn":"This is the address and the phone number."},"1":{"f":"Ich kenne die Adresse. Ich komme morgen mit.","fn":"I know the address. I'll come along tomorrow."},"2":{"f"